flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[/Enter account email/]
 B --> C{Email exists?}
 C -- No --> D[/Account not found/]
 C -- Yes --> E[/Display code in same page/]
 E --> F[/Enter code and new password/]
 F --> G{Code matches and length at least 6?}
 G -- No --> H[/Error/]
 H -- Retry --> F
 G -- Yes --> I[(Replace stored password)]
 I --> J([End])
 